laygrounds","name":"東船迫一丁目公園","category":"nature","address":"柴田郡柴田町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"04323","municipality_pref":"宮城県","municipality_name":"柴田町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.78497391,38.0658016]}}],"display_comment_original":"柴田町周辺には、近世村の記憶として舟岡村、上名生村、中名生村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、富沢磨崖仏群、大光院、八幡神社のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、舟岡村、上名生村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["山岡重長","原田宗輔","原田宗資","屋代景頼"],"notable_people":["山岡重長","原田宗輔","原田宗資","屋代景頼","柴田朝意"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["船岡城址公園（桜の名所、船岡城跡）","山本周五郎","白石川堤一目千本桜（桜の名所）","隣の大河原町から続く約8km、約1200本の桜並木で有名。","日本さくら名所100選","麹屋コレクション","自然休養村「太陽の村」","表蔵王国際ゴルフクラブ"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%B4%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11467846","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11409811","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11409810","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q8049746","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11534845","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11504397","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11481996","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11436908","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11459670","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11485588","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%B1%B1%E5%B2%A1%E9%87%8D%E9%95%B7&keyword=%E6%9F%B4%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"柴田町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110380702","wikidata_qid":"Q1204965","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%B4%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%B1%B1%E5%B2%A1%E9%87%8D%E9%95%B7&keyword=%E6%9F%B4%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}